    <!-- Every XDR string maps to one policy alias; baseline offsets do not apply to list items and are zero.
         Mixed record texts use ordered variants: the first matching pattern selects the protected captures,
         unmatched bytes stay unchanged, and each list ends with a catch-all that protects unknown records whole. -->
